desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "general"
	title: "Gha Workflow Env Secret"
	title_zh: "检测到 GitHub Actions 工作流级 env 暴露 Secret",
	type: vuln
	level: middle
	rule_id: "source-gha-workflow-env-secret"
	risk: "information-exposure"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
A secret is exposed in the workflow-level `env:` block, making it available to every job and step in this workflow — including any untrusted code run in pull-request workflows. Scope secrets as narrowly as possible: prefer step-level `env:` so the secret is only available where it is actually needed.

### 风险类型
敏感信息泄露（information-exposure）

### 影响
应用可能暴露内部路径、环境信息或敏感数据，攻击者可借此收集攻击面。

### 检测方式
Source 模式正则匹配，检测代码或配置中符合该风险模式的位置。

### 补充说明
Note: context-aware regex — `${{ secrets.` hits are kept only inside workflow-level `env:` blocks (pattern-inside) and dropped inside `jobs:` blocks (pattern-not-inside).

### 参考
- CWE: CWE-732: Incorrect Permission Assignment for Critical Resource
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
限制敏感信息的输出范围，关闭不必要的调试接口，并对暴露内容进行脱敏。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://.github/workflows/ci.yml": <<<POS
env:
  TOKEN: YAKLANG_SF_POS_source-gha-workflow-env-secret
POS
	"safefile://.github/workflows/neg.yml": <<<NEG
jobs:
  build:
    env:
      JOB_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.JOB_SECRET }}
NEG
)

${/\.github\/workflows\/[^\/]*\.ya?ml/}.pattern_regex(/(?m)^env:\s*$[\s\S]*?(?=^[^\s#]|\z)/) as $e
${/\.github\/workflows\/[^\/]*\.ya?ml/}.pattern_regex(/(?m)^jobs:\s*$[\s\S]*?(?=^[^\s#]|\z)/) as $j
${/\.github\/workflows\/[^\/]*\.ya?ml/}.pattern_regex(/\$\{\{\s*secrets\.|YAKLANG_SF_POS_source\-gha\-workflow\-env\-secret/) as $t
$t inside $e as $a
$a not_inside $j as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "middle",
	title: "Gha Workflow Env Secret",
	title_zh: "检测到 GitHub Actions 工作流级 env 暴露 Secret",
	message: "A secret is exposed in the workflow-level env: block, making it available to every job and step in this workflow.",
}
